<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;"><tr><td align="center"><img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2025/04/11464279/6140804/columbus-one-culture-day-2025-email-invite_crop.png" style="width: 398px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="One Culture Day " width="398" height="393"></td></tr></table>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"> </p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center">Join the Department of Neighborhoods for the One Columbus Culture Day, on <strong>Thursday, May 1st at 4300 Kimberly Parkway, Columbus, OH 43232 <br>from 4:30 p.m. to 7:30 p.m.</strong></p>
